# 基本動画再生 (design 11.12, 15), for tools/ui_run.py: a sample of 実時間制御TAD
# opened in its window, begun, paused, its menu, a playlist, closed; and the
# programs 実行 offers for a link by the type of its object's record. The
# window is one of the desktop's: its band carries it, its corner sizes it.
# The menu of the second button opens with the item chosen last on the
# pointer's row, the rows 20 pixels apart: 閉じる, line, 表示, プレイリスト表示,
# 操作, ウインドウ, 小物, 実行.
open 01a0d8c5-6a04-7a04-8a04-5e1a7d000004
expect player: opened 10.4 アニメーションとの同期
wait 800
shot player_waiting
key 2C
wait 500
shot player_playing
key 13 01
wait 300
shot player_paused
click 480 360 1
expect desktop: menu 10.4 アニメーションとの同期
wait 500
shot player_menu
key 29
wait 300
# プレイリスト表示 of the menu (閉じる under the pointer, three rows below): its list, put away
click 480 360 1
wait 300
click 488 420
expect desktop: chosen rt.list
wait 500
shot player_list
key 29
wait 300
win 10.4 アニメーションとの同期
drag 400 75 440 95
wait 300
win 10.4 アニメーションとの同期
drag 916 674 860 620
wait 500
win 10.4 アニメーションとの同期
shot player_moved
key 08 01
expect player: closed
open 01a0d8c5-6a05-7a05-8a05-5e1a7d000005
expect player: opened 10.5 音声プレイリスト
key 2C
wait 2500
